        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alonso López, Ricardo López\n- Roles: professional boxer, retired boxer, world boxing champion\n- Sports divisions and titles: Flyweight division, IBF Light Flyweight Championship\n- Places: Mexico City, Mexico\n\nFacts:\n- Ricardo López was born on July 25, 1966, and he is a retired undefeated Mexican professional boxer.\n- Alonso López was born on May 28, 1986, in Mexico City, and he is an undefeated Mexican professional boxer in the Flyweight division.\n- Alonso López is the son of former World Boxing Champion Ricardo López.\n- Ricardo López later won the IBF Light Flyweight Championship and defended the title twice before retiring.",
